<p>At last you unlock the true power of your mutated body!</p><p>You gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">16%, 26%, 34%, 39%, 44%</acronym> stun immunity, <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 26%, 35%, 43%, 50%</acronym> chances to ignore critical strikes and your darkness and blight damage are increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3%, 7%, 10%, 12%, 14%.</acronym></p>